      "shots": [
        {
          "id": "shot_001",
          "intent": "建立场景，用微风打破宁静，铺垫即将发生的冲突",
          "shot_type": "MCU",
          "duration_frames": 120,
          "start_frame": 1,
          "end_frame": 120,
          "transition_in": "cut",
          "transition_out": "cut",
          "camera": {
            "id": "BD_Cam_shot_001",
            "position": [
              0.0,
              2.895,
              1.231
            ],
            "target": [
              0.0,
              0.0,
              1.231
            ],
            "lens": 50.0,
            "sensor_width": 36.0,
            "movement": "static",
            "movements": [],
            "request": {}
          },
          "axis_line": null,
          "active_speakers": [],
          "characters": [],
          "actions": [],
          "dialogues": [],
          "gaze": [],
          "vfx": [],
          "prompt": "第十四街区码头市场 - 午后。暖侧光营造宁静氛围。市场环境，远处的集装箱和脚手架在暖光下泛着金边。市场入口处，几片落叶在地面缓缓滚动，被微风轻轻吹起，在空地上打转。远处的摊位和行人虚化，前景是市场入口的拱门和地面。微风拂过，树叶沙沙作响，空气中飘着细小的尘埃。整体色调温暖柔和，营造出午后慵懒而宁静的氛围，为即将发生的冲突做铺垫。"
        },
        {
          "id": "shot_002",
          "intent": "建立米迦尔的角色性格，引出战斗",
          "shot_type": "CU",
          "duration_frames": 144,
          "start_frame": 121,
          "end_frame": 264,
          "transition_in": "cut",
          "transition_out": "cut",
          "camera": {
            "id": "BD_Cam_shot_002",
            "position": [
              -1.7,
              -4.429,
              1.278
            ],
            "target": [
              -1.7,
              0.0,
              1.278
            ],
            "lens": 85.0,
            "sensor_width": 36.0,
            "movement": "dolly_in",
            "movements": [
              {
                "type": "dolly_in"
              }
            ],
            "request": {}
          },
          "axis_line": null,
          "active_speakers": [
            "米迦尔",
            "伊恩"
          ],
          "characters": [
            "米迦尔",
            "伊恩"
          ],
          "actions": [],
          "dialogues": [
            {
              "character_id": "米迦尔",
              "speaker_raw": "米迦尔",
              "speaker_status": "resolved",
              "text": "伊恩，这里就交给我吧！",
              "start_frame": 0,
              "end_frame": 0
            }
          ],
          "gaze": [
            {
              "from": "米迦尔",
              "to": "伊恩"
            }
          ],
          "vfx": [],
          "prompt": "米迦尔特写镜头，自信表情，右手握拳准备战斗，背景虚化显示伊恩侧脸"
        },
        {
          "id": "shot_003",
          "intent": "表现两人的搭档关系",
          "shot_type": "MCU",
          "duration_frames": 96,
          "start_frame": 265,
          "end_frame": 360,
          "transition_in": "cut",
          "transition_out": "cut",
          "camera": {
            "id": "BD_Cam_shot_003",
            "position": [
              0.0,
              2.895,
              1.231
            ],
            "target": [
              0.0,
              0.0,
              1.231
            ],
            "lens": 50.0,
            "sensor_width": 36.0,
            "movement": "static",
            "movements": [],
            "request": {}
          },
          "axis_line": null,
          "active_speakers": [
            "伊恩"
          ],
          "characters": [
            "伊恩"
          ],
          "actions": [],
          "dialogues": [
            {
              "character_id": "伊恩",
              "speaker_raw": "伊恩",
              "speaker_status": "resolved",
              "text": "好的，那你多小心一些。",
              "start_frame": 0,
              "end_frame": 0
            }
          ],
          "gaze": [
            {
              "from": "伊恩",
              "to": "米迦尔"
            }
          ],
          "vfx": [],
          "prompt": "伊恩站在码头市场一角，中近景，身体微微前倾，专注地看着米迦尔。伊恩双手自然下垂或轻搭在身前，表情认真而关切。米迦尔在画面右侧，正在自信地回应。镜头固定，焦距50mm，捕捉两人对话时的默契关系。伊恩说完台词后微微点头，眼神中带着关切。"
        },
        {
          "id": "shot_004",
          "intent": "铺垫米迦尔即将施法，暗示魔法即将出现",
          "shot_type": "CU",
          "duration_frames": 144,
          "start_frame": 361,
          "end_frame": 504,
          "transition_in": "cut",
          "transition_out": "cut",
